        "releaseDate": null,
        "description": "Captures and versions Splunk knowledge objects (dashboards, reports, alerts, macros, event types, field extractions, lookup definitions and tags) into a summary index so admins can audit changes and recover content after accidental deletes, overwrites or moves. Bundles custom visualizations and a React app page for inline visual version-history diffs and change overlays. All seven object types are captured, previewed and compared; one-click restore covers dashboards and saved searches.",
